window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The Summit has been called and the clans have gathered.</b></p> <p>A war is brewing in the Wastes, and I seem to be in the center. With old horrors stirring, and bonds breaking can, I do what it takes to save us all? Or will my need for vengeance be our downfall? </p> <p>First, I have to face my biggest challenge yet, myself. One thing is certain, the sands will turn red before The Summit is through.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
